message: "If you use this software or simulation suite, please cite it as below."
title: "Where Does a Fractal-Seeded Controller Stand? A Simulation Study Positioning a 24-Byte, Estimation-Free Difficulty Controller Against Adaptive Testing, Staircase Rules and a Language Model"
abstract: "A comprehensive simulation study evaluating a 24-byte fractal-seeded adaptive difficulty controller (LearningGate) across synthetic non-stationary regimes, empirical student replays from ASSISTments 2009-2010 and 2017 datasets, and frontier language model comparisons."
